'''Kadavo''' was an ugly, barren [[planet]]<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> located in the [[Kadavo system]] of [[Wild Space]].<ref name="Appendix" /> During the [[Clone Wars]], it was under the control of the [[Zygerrian Slave Empire]],<ref name="Slaves of the Republic" /> which used it to process [[Slavery|slaves]].<ref name="VE" /> Kadavo had multiple [[volcano]]es, but for the most part, they were dormant. Nonetheless, the planet's atmosphere was affected and remained filled with smog.<ref name="Databank" /> In 20 BBY, [[Plo Koon]] led an [[Battle of Kadavo|operation to free the captured Togruta slaves]] being held in the facility. The processing facility was completely destroyed, along with it's [[Agruss|Keeper]] and garrison. The slaves were all liberated. 

